@startuml RetrievalService_Sequence
skinparam SequenceMessageFontSize 14
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontSize 16
skinparam maxMessageSize 250
scale 1.5

actor Pipeline
participant "RetrievalService" as RS
participant "Vector DB\n(Qdrant)" as DB
participant "Reranker" as Rerank

Pipeline -> RS: retrieve(query)

RS -> RS: Embed query\n(dense + sparse)
RS -> RS: Extract quoted/named\npaper title from query

alt title fragment found AND article resolved
    RS -> DB: find_article_id_by_title(title_fragment)
    DB --> RS: article_id
    RS -> DB: hybrid_search_vectors_filtered(article_id)\ntop_k = max(reranked_chunk_limit,\nmax_chunks_per_article x 10) = 50
    DB --> RS: 50 chunk candidates\n(single article)
else no title fragment / article not found
    RS -> DB: hybrid_search_vectors (all articles)\ntop_k = max(candidate_chunks_per_query,\nfinal_top_k x 20) = 200
    DB --> RS: 200 chunk candidates\n(across articles)
end

RS -> Rerank: rerank(query, ALL chunk_candidates)\n(cross-encoder scores every\ncandidate passed in - no\ninternal truncation)
Rerank --> RS: All candidates,\nsorted by relevance score\n(50 or 200, same count as input)

RS -> RS: Slice to top\nreranked_chunk_limit = 50

note right of RS
  Reranking happens on
  individual CHUNKS, before
  grouping into articles.
end note

RS -> RS: Group the (up to 50)\nreranked chunks by article_id
note right: N unique articles\n(N <= 50, varies by\nchunk distribution)

RS -> RS: Per article:\n- keep top max_chunks_per_article (5)\n  chunks by rerank score\n- re-sort by chunk_index\n- concatenate with [SECTION] tags\n  into one merged document

RS -> RS: Sort N merged articles\nby best chunk score,\ncap to final_top_k = 5

RS --> Pipeline: 5 documents + scores\n(sigmoid-mapped relevance)

@enduml